        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Samuele wakamwaambila makani oonse, teewakasisa cintu niciba comwe. Lino wakaamba wati, Ngu-Jehova! acite kufumbwa cintu cimubotela kumeso aakwe.",
          "type": "text",
